elt like the same card again and again.\n\nWhat bothers me is the words I forgot that no card asked about: можешь, сюда, порядке, день, делать, after. Those never came back. Also, 4 cards didn't match any saved word.","costUsd":0.0064018,"usage":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":268,"cacheReadTokens":2058,"cacheCreationTokens":878}},{"bot":"silent-ru","week":2,"runId":"38355843476","text":"This week felt a bit too hard for me. I played all 7 days across 9 sessions and got 47 right out of 90 cards. Choice cards were kind to me, like cloze choice and multiple choice, and the two sentence translations went well. Typing was rough. Letter tiles and typed translation were shaky, and both cloze typed cards were wrong.\n\nNothing repeated inside a session, so I never felt drilled on the same word. Some words did return later, like много after 8 days and всего after 6, and a few came back just in time, like сказать and тут after 3 days.\n\nWhat bothers me is the words I forgot that never came back: можешь, сюда, всегда, день, делать, после, потом, такой, and even боже, сэр and мистер. I saved 22 new words, but 6 cards couldn't be matched to any of them.","costUsd":0.008999899999999998,"usage":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":521,"cacheReadTokens":2059,"cacheCreationTokens":895}}],"progress":{"day":16,"lookups":5,"sessions":0}}
